<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S PETITO WINS TOUR OF SARDINIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S PETITO WINS TOUR OF SARDINIA.</headline>
<dateline>LA MADDALENA, Sardinia 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberto Petito of Italy won the Tour of Sardinia cycle race on Sunday, according to unofficial results.</p>
<p>Compatriot Massimiliano Mori won the fifth and final stage.</p>
</text>
